	println!("hello")
}
;;

text: NOTE: code blocks require the ;; terminator be at the end on its own line,
this is because a handful of langs use ;;.

include: file_location ;;

list: Architecture & Task Lists
  * Arrow Items
    -> Zero-copy memory access
    -> SIMD line scanning
  * 123 Items
    1 Parse front-matter
    2 Interpolate variables
    3 Lex body tokens
  * Abc Items
    A Core Rust Parser
    B Terminal Renderer
  * Checkbox Items
    [ ] Complete Logos lexer pass
    [ ] Verify circular inclusion protection
      # remember to run integration test suite
;;

tree: Vault Root

  Core/
    Parser/
      meta.rs
      lexer.rs
    Renderer/
      terminal.rs
      web.rs

  Assets/
    diagram.png
    schema.json
;;

expandable:
  title = How to run parser tests
  content = cargo test --test parser_spec
;;

table:
teams   | core, backend, frontend
status  | Production Ready, active, pending
latency | sub-ms, 1ms, 2ms
;;


